{"id":"5190d793d205578e","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-order11-prime-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Prime Ideal","display":"df-zfc-order11-prime-ideal — ZFC Order11 Prime Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-prime-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-prime-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-prime-ideal — ZFC Order11 Prime Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-prime-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-prime-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-prime-ideal — ZFC Order11 Prime Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L,I\\in V,\\quad I\\subseteq L\">\\(L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L,I\\in V,\\quad I\\subseteq L\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lattice}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lattice}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11PrimeIdeal}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11PrimeIdeal}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{Lattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(L,\\leq_L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\wedge_L,L\\times L,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vee_L,L\\times L,L)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;\\left((z\\leq_L x\\land z\\leq_L y\\leftrightarrow z\\leq_L(x\\wedge_L y))\\land(x\\leq_L z\\land y\\leq_L z\\leftrightarrow(x\\vee_L y)\\leq_L z)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{Lattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(L,\\leq_L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\wedge_L,L\\times L,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vee_L,L\\times L,L)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;\\left((z\\leq_L x\\land z\\leq_L y\\leftrightarrow z\\leq_L(x\\wedge_L y))\\land(x\\leq_L z\\land y\\leq_L z\\leftrightarrow(x\\vee_L y)\\leq_L z)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11PrimeIdeal}_S(I,L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Lattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L)\\land\\varnothing\\neq I\\subsetneq L\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in L\\;(y\\leq_L x\\to y\\in I)\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(x\\vee_L y\\in I)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;(x\\wedge_L y\\in I\\to(x\\in I\\lor y\\in I))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11PrimeIdeal}_S(I,L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Lattice}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L)\\land\\varnothing\\neq I\\subsetneq L\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in L\\;(y\\leq_L x\\to y\\in I)\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(x\\vee_L y\\in I)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;(x\\wedge_L y\\in I\\to(x\\in I\\lor y\\in I))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a prime lattice ideal: lower, closed under finite joins, proper, and prime with respect to meets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\leq_L,\\wedge_L,\\vee_L,I\\in V,\\quad I\\subseteq L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lattice}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder